  "support": "A fragment of a block of the local soft white limestone, with the surface finished and then red letters painted directly onto the stone. Intact on the right side, broken on the left and below, and perhaps incomplete at the top (the top appears to be worked and finished, perhaps to receive another block above). Modern plaster suppport added to the base. The rear is uneven and curves and is only roughly finished.",
