  "handNote": {
    "lettering": "Finely painted Hellenistic letters in rigid style without serfis. Alpha has straight bar; epsilon has short middle bar; omicron is small and above the line (14-17 mm); omega is small, circular, closed, and almost sits on the line (19 mm).",
